  "id": "native-research-efficiency-20260920",
  "implementation_boundary": "Project-owned freezing, native command orchestration, usage normalization and blind export around upstream QMD CLI, official OpenAI Codex SDK and Claude CLI. No upstream whole-stack efficiency feature is claimed.",
